  "2018 P1 Q5": {"skill":"Collinear points: the ratio, then a missing coordinate.","method":"(a) 1 mark, (b) 1 mark","moves":["(a) Compare the \\(x\\)-coordinates: how far is it from \\(A\\) to \\(B\\), and from \\(B\\) to \\(C\\)?","(b) \\(B\\) is \\(\\frac{4}{5}\\) of the way from \\(A\\) to \\(C\\): use the \\(y\\)-coordinates to find \\(t\\)."],"marks":[1,1],"shows":[null,null]},
  "2018 P1 Q6": {"skill":"Evaluating a combination of logs.","method":"3 marks","moves":["Move the \\(\\frac{1}{3}\\) up as a power: \\(\\frac{1}{3}\\log_5 8 = \\log_5 8^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\).","Subtract by dividing inside one log.","Write the number inside as a power of \\(5\\) to evaluate."],"marks":[1,1,1],"shows":["\\(\\log_5 8^{\\frac{1}{3}}\\)","\\(\\log_5\\left(\\dfrac{250}{8^{\\frac{1}{3}}}\\right)\\)",null]},
  "2018 P1 Q7": {"skill":"A tangent to a cubic, then where it meets the curve again.","method":"(a) 1 mark, (b) 3 marks, (c) 4 marks","moves":["(a) The curve crosses the \\(y\\)-axis where \\(x = 0\\).","(b) Differentiate, and substitute \\(x = 0\\) for the gradient.","(b) Write the equation of the tangent.","(c) Set the curve equal to the tangent and collect everything on one side.","(c) Factorise it.","(c) Take the root that is not \\(P\\), and find its \\(y\\)-coordinate."],"marks":[1,2,1,1,1,2],"shows":[null,"\\(3x^2 - 6x + 2\\)",null,"\\(x^3 - 3x^2 = 0\\)","\\(x^2(x - 3)\\)",null]},
